					"patch": 0
				}
			},
			"description": "Field Viewer - example effect: shows the Motion Bridge field texture as it arrives in a patch. In Arena, load the Spout source 'Motion Bridge' as a clip, set its Resize to Stretch, and put this patch on it as an effect. Channel: All shows red = occupancy, green = motion, blue = visibility; or one channel as grey. Show Band: the top sixteenth of the texture is the bridge's status band; its counter is drawn as a yellow bar that must keep moving (about 8.5 s per cycle); a yellow line marks the expected lower edge of the band, a magenta line where it would be if the rows arrive flipped. Show Size: four bars from the bottom, length log2(pixels)/12 (4096 px = full width): input width (cyan), input height (orange), render width and render height (grey). Equal input and render bars mean the field is stretched to the composition.",
			"displayName": "Field Viewer",
			"identifier": "e4e85327-fd0d-43d5-9327-837b536cd094",
			"licenseName": "Unlicense",
			"mail": "S.Mazur@cati-co.de",
